# Where the editor lives. Read at BUILD time by Vite and compiled into the
# bundle — setting it on the running container does nothing.
#
# This is the single source of truth for the production build. The Dockerfile
# takes a VITE_APP_URL build arg that overrides it for one build via
# .env.production.local, which is the precedence Vite already defines.
VITE_APP_URL=https://app.webxite.org
